  "description": "CUSTOM #1: INSIDE GRID\n\nThe diamonds act as an \"Inside Grid\", that being a separate 5x5 Sudoku puzzle rotated 45 degrees. However, while the Inside Grid must only consist of 5 unique numbers, those numbers are NOT simply 1-5, and are completely unknown from the start. You'll have to figure out which numbers to use...\n\n-\n\nCUSTOM #2: RENBAN THERMOMETER\n\nEach thermometer doubles as a Renban line, meaning each adjacent number on the thermometer must have a difference of 1; figure out one number and you've figured out the whole thermometer. This custom rule was borrowed from Hanson, much respect goes to them! https://sudoku.coach/en/user/12130147\n\n-\n\nI might make a harder version of this puzzle at a later date, so keep an eye out for it",
